01:53','2025-10-05 11:01:53','',0,'http://localhost:8080/wpcode/top-container-search-input/',0,'wpcode','',0),(440,1,'2025-10-04 13:00:04','2025-10-04 13:00:04','','images removebg preview','','inherit','open','closed','','images-removebg-preview','','','2025-10-04 13:00:04','2025-10-04 13:00:04','',418,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/images-removebg-preview.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(442,1,'2025-10-04 13:48:08','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Acceuil','','draft','closed','closed','','','','','2025-10-04 13:48:08','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?p=442',1,'nav_menu_item','',0),(443,1,'2025-10-04 13:48:52','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','AXES','','draft','closed','closed','','','','','2025-10-04 13:48:52','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?p=443',1,'nav_menu_item','',0),(444,1,'2025-10-04 13:55:18','2025-10-04 13:55:18','About		\n			<h1>We are Passionate About Our Work</h1>		\n													<img width=\\\"590\\\" height=\\\"610\\\" src=\\\"https://websitedemos.net/generic-ecommerce-02/wp-content/uploads/sites/1526/2025/03/about-us.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" srcset=\\\"https://websitedemos.net/generic-ecommerce-02/wp-content/uploads/sites/1526/2025/03/about-us.jpg 590w, https://websitedemos.net/generic-ecommerce-02/wp-content/uploads/sites/1526/2025/03/about-us-290x300.jpg 290w, https://websitedemos.net/generic-ecommerce-02/wp-content/uploads/sites/1526/2025/03/about-us-400x414.jpg 400w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\\\" />													\n			<h2>We strive to provide our customers with the highest quality</h2>		\n		Urban Jungle Co. was founded in 1960 by a group of plant enthusiasts who recognized the positive impact that plants can have on our lives. Whether it\\\'s purifying the air, reducing stress, or simply adding a touch of beauty to your environment, plants are more than just decorationÔÇötheyÔÇÖre a lifestyle.		\n		ÔÇ£We love what we do & create partnerships with our clients to ensure their digital transformation is positioned for long-term success.ÔÇØ		\n			<figure><img width=\\\"100\\\" height=\\\"100\\\" src=\\\"https://websitedemos.net/generic-ecommerce-02/wp-content/uploads/sites/1526/2025/03/testimonial.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" /></figure><h6>Karen Lynn</h6><p>CEO & Co-founder @ Company</p>		\n			<h2>Our Core Values that Drive Everything We Do</h2>		\n				<svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 512 512\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><path d=\\\"M239.1 6.3l-208 78c-18.7 7-31.1 25-31.1 45v225.1c0 18.2 10.3 34.8 26.5 42.9l208 104c13.5 6.8 29.4 6.8 42.9 0l208-104c16.3-8.1 26.5-24.8 26.5-42.9V129.3c0-20-12.4-37.9-31.1-44.9l-208-78C262 2.2 250 2.2 239.1 6.3zM256 68.4l192 72v1.1l-192 78-192-78v-1.1l192-72zm32 356V275.5l160-65v133.9l-160 80z\\\"></path></svg>				\n									<h4>\n							Passionate About Work						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						Passion for work is a enthusiasm and excitement for what you do.					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 512 512\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><path d=\\\"M239.1 6.3l-208 78c-18.7 7-31.1 25-31.1 45v225.1c0 18.2 10.3 34.8 26.5 42.9l208 104c13.5 6.8 29.4 6.8 42.9 0l208-104c16.3-8.1 26.5-24.8 26.5-42.9V129.3c0-20-12.4-37.9-31.1-44.9l-208-78C262 2.2 250 2.2 239.1 6.3zM256 68.4l192 72v1.1l-192 78-192-78v-1.1l192-72zm32 356V275.5l160-65v133.9l-160 80z\\\"></path></svg>				\n									<h4>\n							Creative team members						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						A creative team is to design and execute campaigns & encourage					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 512 512\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><path d=\\\"M239.1 6.3l-208 78c-18.7 7-31.1 25-31.1 45v225.1c0 18.2 10.3 34.8 26.5 42.9l208 104c13.5 6.8 29.4 6.8 42.9 0l208-104c16.3-8.1 26.5-24.8 26.5-42.9V129.3c0-20-12.4-37.9-31.1-44.9l-208-78C262 2.2 250 2.2 239.1 6.3zM256 68.4l192 72v1.1l-192 78-192-78v-1.1l192-72zm32 356V275.5l160-65v133.9l-160 80z\\\"></path></svg>				\n									<h4>\n							Innovation solutions						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						Using either completely concepts finding new ways of using existing					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 512 512\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><path d=\\\"M239.1 6.3l-208 78c-18.7 7-31.1 25-31.1 45v225.1c0 18.2 10.3 34.8 26.5 42.9l208 104c13.5 6.8 29.4 6.8 42.9 0l208-104c16.3-8.1 26.5-24.8 26.5-42.9V129.3c0-20-12.4-37.9-31.1-44.9l-208-78C262 2.2 250 2.2 239.1 6.3zM256 68.4l192 72v1.1l-192 78-192-78v-1.1l192-72zm32 356V275.5l160-65v133.9l-160 80z\\\"></path></svg>				\n									<h4>\n							Qualitiful products						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						Product quality refers to how well a product satisfies our customer					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 512 512\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><path d=\\\"M239.1 6.3l-208 78c-18.7 7-31.1 25-31.1 45v225.1c0 18.2 10.3 34.8 26.5 42.9l208 104c13.5 6.8 29.4 6.8 42.9 0l208-104c16.3-8.1 26.5-24.8 26.5-42.9V129.3c0-20-12.4-37.9-31.1-44.9l-208-78C262 2.2 250 2.2 239.1 6.3zM256 68.4l192 72v1.1l-192 78-192-78v-1.1l192-72zm32 356V275.5l160-65v133.9l-160 80z\\\"></path></svg>				\n									<h4>\n							Customer satisfaction						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						Happy customers are delighted because of the customer service					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 512 512\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><path d=\\\"M239.1 6.3l-208 78c-18.7 7-31.1 25-31.1 45v225.1c0 18.2 10.3 34.8 26.5 42.9l208 104c13.5 6.8 29.4 6.8 42.9 0l208-104c16.3-8.1 26.5-24.8 26.5-42.9V129.3c0-20-12.4-37.9-31.1-44.9l-208-78C262 2.2 250 2.2 239.1 6.3zM256 68.4l192 72v1.1l-192 78-192-78v-1.1l192-72zm32 356V275.5l160-65v133.9l-160 80z\\\"></path></svg>				\n									<h4>\n							Simplicity interface						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						Simplicity is used loosely to refer to the need to minimize a process					</p>\n			<h2>Our Mission</h2>		\n		Our mission is to make the world a greener place, one plant at a tim